  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the current system how avatar 3.0 works it is kinda complicated for new users to use. I would suggest a separate way by using an editor script, which would be included with VRCSDK 3.0. That script would setup an avatar with the basics that an avatar would need. Of course the things generated would be able to be edited and extended, but I think a tool or similar to it would benefit the players who are having second thoughts of switching to avatar 3.0.",
